{"id":"7a6acca54be09a6b95eaf72513df46e3f2d0db91","axis":"silent","repo":"apache/airflow","sha":"7a6acca54be09a6b95eaf72513df46e3f2d0db91","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"airflow-core/docs/ui.rst","lines":["@@ -167,6 +167,11 @@ Use Grid View to:"," - **Understand the status of recent Dag runs** at a glance"," - **Identify failed or retried tasks** by color and tooltip"," - **Take action** by clicking a task cell to view logs or mark task instances as successful, failed, or cleared","+- **Act on several task instances at once**: Ctrl + click (Cmd + click on macOS) adds or removes a cell, and","+  Shift + click selects every cell between the last one picked and the clicked one. The selected task instances can","+  then be cleared, marked, or deleted together, and the actions of the details panel are hidden meanwhile. A mapped","+  task's cell stands for all of its mapped task instances. Task groups and tasks inside a loop cannot be selected","+  this way."," - **Filter tasks** by name or partial ID"," - **Select a run range**, like \"last 25 runs\" using the dropdown above the grid"," "],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"airflow-core/src/airflow/ui/public/i18n/locales/en/common.json","lines":["@@ -381,10 +381,12 @@","       \"scrollBottom\": \"Scroll to bottom\",","       \"scrollTop\": \"Scroll to top\",","       \"searchDags\": \"Search $t(dag_other)\",","+      \"selectGridCellRange\": \"Select a range of $t(taskInstance_other) (not $t(taskGroup_other) or loop tasks)\",","       \"showHelp\": \"Show $t(shortcuts.title)\",","       \"toggleExpand\": \"Expand or collapse all groups\",","       \"toggleFullscreen\": \"Toggle fullscreen\",","       \"toggleGraphGrid\": \"Toggle graph / grid view\",","+      \"toggleGridCellSelection\": \"Add or remove a $t(taskInstance_one) from the selection (not $t(taskGroup_other) or loop tasks)\",","       \"toggleLogLevel\": \"Toggle log levels\",","       \"toggleSource\": \"Toggle source\",","       \"toggleTask